// src/v4/compiler/emit_host.dag
// Scope: T-38 / rung-4 host harness — emit + host execute + eval compare (compiler orchestration).
// Status: T-22 rust/go rows — eval intercept (`emit_host_eval.rs`) runs `emit_host_runner` and
//   assembles receipts via `emit_host_receipt_from_source` (substrate eval, not hand-encoded).
//   T-22 python row — eval intercept dispatches `run_emit_host_python` → `emit_host_runner` and
//   hand-reifies `v4.std.host_run` in `emit_host_eval.rs` (claim-only transport pins).
//   `emit_host_bridge.rs` remains for W3 harness until T-PB-B dissolution (SG-0 receipts).
// Layer: compiler/ (imports emit/eval; std/ carries host_run + falsification receipts only).
// Authority: docs/planning/compiler-spine-runtime-rung34-min-runner-interface-2026-05-30.md §4.2 (A1–A4).

